        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your girlfriend know (or not) about the culprit who ate her ice cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738050/extras/7cafeb43aaec2ab9ded889e236b75c9f.avif?t=1777628286\" width=300 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>La~ la~ la~ It's time to eat my ice cream~</i> 🍦</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >975 words, that's around 5-15 minutes playing time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 mode: decide in advance on <strong>who</strong> ate the ice cream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different endings for each mode: 4 endings in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 visible stats and 2 hidden stats: you can't always know what your girlfriend is thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to be truthful, or not. And get what you deserve, or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girlfriend! 🥺💕🎀🍦</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >story, art, programming: Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bgm: なかよしクッキング - 蒲鉾さちこ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >proofreading: ebi-hime (thank you so much!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >programming extra help: an anonymous family member (thank you again!)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Translators:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Українська: Mykhailo Mukha</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >日本語: Jun Kurihara 栗原純</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >한국어: doesthiscostmoney</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >简体中文：游天梦穗, Johnson123</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Français: Aquillia</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 